          "type": "text",
          "text": "You are shepherding PR #817 through CI to merge.\n\nRepository: anchapin/nexus-proxy\nPR: https://github.com/anchapin/nexus-proxy/pull/817\nBranch: fix/issue-790-model-unavailable-metric\nWorkdir: /home/alex/AI/worktrees/issue-790-model-unavailable-metric\n\nSteps:\n1. Check CI status: gh pr checks 817\n2. IF CI is green:\n   a. Check mergeable: gh pr view 817 --json mergeable\n   b. If CONFLICTING → follow the merge conflict protocol\n   c. If MERGEABLE → merge: gh pr merge 817 --squash --delete-branch\n      Verify: gh pr view 817 --json mergedAt --jq '.mergedAt'\n      - mergedAt NOT null → merge succeeded\n      - mergedAt null → retry merge once; if still null → BLOCKED\n   d. Clean up: git worktree remove ../worktrees/issue-790-model-unavailable-metric\n3. IF CI is failing:\n   a. Get failing run: gh run list --branch fix/issue-790-model-unavailable-metric --limit 1\n   b. Get logs: gh run view <RUN_ID> --log\n   c. Diagnose and fix in the worktree\n   d. Commit and push: git add -A && git commit -m \"fix: resolve CI failure\" && git push\n   e. Wait for CI (poll every 30s, max 10 iterations)\n   f. If still failing after 10 → report BLOCKER\n4. IF merge conflict:\n   a. git fetch origin develop\n   b. git rebase origin/develop\n   c. Auto-resolve where possible; escalate if unresolvable\n   d. git push --force-with-lease origin fix/issue-790-model-unavailable-metric\n\nReport back: final status (MERGED / BLOCKED / CONFLICT), iterations used.",
